SURFACE PARITY — what was ported from the web source (no scope narrowing)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
• Composition : title "Charging diagnosis" + Helix badge (web AIBadge) + the plain-language description +
                the "Ask Helix" Generate action (web AIFeatureCard universal CTA, aria-label "Ask Helix ·
                Generate diagnosis") + the streamed AiOutputPanel — every region of AIChargingDiagnosis.tsx +
                the AIFeatureCard / AiOutputPanel scaffold it renders through.
• useAiStream : the hook's lifecycle (idle | streaming | paused-confirm | done | error) is ported verbatim as
                AIDiagnosisStreamState; the diagnose endpoint memo
                (sessionId ? /ai/charging/{encodeURIComponent(id)}/diagnose : /ai/charging/0/diagnose)
                is ported as AIDiagnosisEndpoint.path(for:) (encodeURIComponent-faithful percent-encoding).
                generate()→stream.start(), cancel()→stream.cancel() are routed through the P1/S8 seam.
• AiOutputPanel: the four render branches (!hasAnything → hidden, error → "Helix error: …", streaming-but-empty
                → AIThinkingIndicator, else → streamed prose) ported as AIDiagnosisOutput + AIDiagnosisOutputPanel.
• AIThinkingIndicator: "Helix is thinking…" label + bouncing dots (web AIThinkingDots) over 3 shimmer skeleton
                lines, Reduce-Motion-aware (dots stop, shimmer drops) — mirrors the web motion-safe: variants.
• canStart    : web buttonDisabled = !canStart || isStreaming ⇒ AIDiagnosisResolved.canGenerate /
                .hasSession / .isStreaming. No bound session ⇒ Generate disabled + a friendly empty hint
                (never a blank box).
• withAiFeature: the AI-off visibility gate (ADR-015) is applied by the HOST that mounts the surface, exactly
                like the web call site wraps InnerSection; this view IS InnerSection (always renders when mounted).
• States      : loading (skeleton chrome) / empty (no session → hint + disabled Generate, never blank) /
                error (host query failure → QueryError peer + retry) / ready (idle → thinking → streamed prose,
                or in-panel "Helix error:" on a stream failure), PLUS the orthogonal connection axis
                live/stale/offline (freshness chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh) — the P4 leaf contract.
• i18n        : 100% via the P1/S10 facade (AIDiagnosisStrings, table "AIChargingDiagnosis"); 20/20 referenced
                keys resolve to a catalog entry; zero English literals in Swift beyond the web-default fallbacks.
• Telemetry   : P1/S11 `view.opened` emitted once with surface slug "AIChargingDiagnosis".
• a11y        : VoiceOver labels on every interactive element (Generate, Stop, Refresh, Retry) + a contained
                surface summary (title + description + live output status), Dynamic Type via Font.TS roles,
                Reduce-Motion-aware fade-in + skeleton shimmer + dot bounce.
• Decomposition: 7 Swift files (page + Adapter + Model + Views + OutputViews + Previews + Tests), 1,472 LoC of
                Swift + the strings table — the established sibling split (Views was divided into Views +
                OutputViews to stay under the SwiftLint 400-line file budget).

